From 9a258c003e3cebc0bebd332871f87bf4bcd87690 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:07:36 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 20/38] fix(demote): demote drops only childless blocks, tail
 first, so it never cuts a cached prefix chain; dropping a middle block
 truncated the router indexer's node and its later removals and stores under
 it failed (demote + prefetch stopped the replay). Cached chains are tracked
 from the KV events with KVCR on

---
 .../core/src/engine/kv_manager/g1_manager.rs  |  8 +++
 .../src/engine/kv_manager/vllm_backend.rs     | 53 ++++++++++++++++++-
 crates/core/src/engine/scheduler/vllm/core.rs | 35 ++++++++----
 .../src/engine/scheduler/vllm/host_offload.rs | 31 +++++++++--
 4 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

